`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Record exact engine/template and AccessKit build, OS/display driver, mode/override, configured update rate, native observer and assistive-technology versions, process/window identity, scene generation, transient element mapping and request timestamps"}),`
`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Compare Auto with absent/present assistive technology against Always Active inspector observation; preserve inactive/unknown/unsupported distinctly. Use headless only as a negative capability case"}),`
`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Change the custom state repeatedly before a flush and test final-generation semantics without demanding an event for every coalesced request. Deliberately omit its semantic update while changing pixels/state; the collector must detect stale semantics"}),`
