`,e.jsx(n.li,{children:"Acceptance requires matching intended state/generation on each claimed surface within a declared observation timeout. A timeout is incomplete evidence, not automatic action failure or permission to repeat it. Actual screen-reader interaction and disabled-player review remain separate; no automated accessibility or legal certification is established"}),`
