`,e.jsxs(n.p,{children:[e.jsx(n.strong,{children:"Suggested check:"})," use a disposable door scene to connect object identification, asset edits, streaming/physics readiness, actual interaction, temporal capture, save and fresh reopen. Include an interrupted action and a stale-reference case. Declare expected world-state transitions and image/geometry tolerances before running. If the project-specific interaction API or event observer is missing, report that gap rather than substituting generic editor dispatch."]}),`
